# 统一换行符，避免 Windows 检出成 CRLF 后 npm run check / build 解析 frontmatter 失败
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
